{"tool_name":"compucell3d","contents":["neubias","oeb","bioschemas","biotools"],"fetched_metadata":{"biotools":{"id":"compucell3d","home":"https://compucell3d.org/SrcBin","license":"GPL-3.0","summary":"CompuCell3D is a multiscale multicellular virtual tissue modeling and simulation environment. CompuCell3D is written in C++ and provides Python bindings for model and simulation development in Python.","addition_date":"2026-05-20T00:15:17.437872Z","last_update_date":"2026-05-20T00:31:43.306086Z","tool_type":["Command-line tool"],"version":["4.8.0"],"accessibility":"Open access","biotools_curie":"biotools:compucell3d","cost":"Free of charge","documentation":[{"type":["API documentation"],"url":"https://compucell3d.org/"},{"type":["Citation instructions"],"url":"https://compucell3d.org/Publications"},{"type":["Training material"],"url":"https://compucell3d.org/Tutorials"}],"edit_permission":{"type":"private"},"function":[{"operation":[{"term":"Modelling and simulation","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_2426"}]}],"maturity":"Mature","name":"CompuCell3D","operating_system":["Linux","Mac","Windows"],"owner":"VKasalica","publication":[{"doi":"10.1016/b978-0-12-388403-9.00013-8","pmcid":"PMC3612985","pmid":"22482955","type":["Primary"]}],"topic":[{"term":"Computational biology","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_3307"},{"term":"Systems biology","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_2259"}]},"bioschemas":{"name":"CompuCell3D","home":"https://bio.tools/compucell3d","license":"GPL-3.0","version":"4.8.0","summary":"CompuCell3D is a multiscale multicellular virtual tissue modeling and simulation environment. CompuCell3D is written in C++ and provides Python bindings for model and simulation development in Python.","tool_type":"sc:SoftwareApplication"},"oeb":{"metrics":[{"@id":"https://openebench.bsc.es/monitor/metrics/biotools:compucell3d:4.8.0/cmd/compucell3d.org","@license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/","@nmsp":"biotools","@type":"metrics","deprecated":true,"distribution":{"sourcecode":{"interpreted":false,"repository":{}}},"project":{"build":{},"deployment":{},"documentation":{"api":true,"citation":true,"training_material":true},"license":{"open_source":true,"osi":true},"publications":[{"entries":[{"cit_count":244,"citations":[{"count":1,"year":"-1"},{"count":2,"year":"2012"},{"count":3,"year":"2013"},{"count":6,"year":"2014"},{"count":13,"year":"2019"},{"count":14,"year":"2015"},{"count":14,"year":"2017"},{"count":14,"year":"2026"},{"count":17,"year":"2018"},{"count":17,"year":"2022"},{"count":18,"year":"2020"},{"count":18,"year":"2023"},{"count":23,"year":"2021"},{"count":24,"year":"2016"},{"count":27,"year":"2025"},{"count":33,"year":"2024"}],"doi":"10.1016/B978-0-12-388403-9.00013-8","pmcid":"PMC3612985","pmid":"22482955","ref_count":49,"refs":[{"count":1,"year":"1972"},{"count":1,"year":"1984"},{"count":1,"year":"1991"},{"count":1,"year":"1992"},{"count":1,"year":"1993"},{"count":1,"year":"1997"},{"count":1,"year":"1998"},{"count":1,"year":"2009"},{"count":2,"year":"1996"},{"count":2,"year":"1999"},{"count":2,"year":"2001"},{"count":2,"year":"2005"},{"count":2,"year":"2006"},{"count":2,"year":"2011"},{"count":3,"year":"1995"},{"count":3,"year":"2008"},{"count":4,"year":"2004"},{"count":4,"year":"2007"},{"count":5,"year":"2000"},{"count":5,"year":"2002"},{"count":5,"year":"2003"}],"title":"Multi-scale modeling of tissues using CompuCell3D.","year":2012}]}],"summary":{"description":true},"website":{"bioschemas":false,"copyright":false,"https":true,"license":false,"operational":200,"ssl":true,"ssl_err":null}}}]},"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>CompuCell3D is a flexible scriptable modeling environment, which allows the rapid construction of sharable Virtual Tissue in-silico simulations of a wide variety of multi-scale, multi-cellular problems including angiogenesis, bacterial colonies, cancer, developmental biology, evolution, the immune system, tissue engineering, toxicology and even non-cellular soft materials. CompuCell3D models have been used to solve basic biological problems, to develop medical therapies, to assess modes of action of toxicants and to design engineered tissues. CompuCell3D intuitive and make Virtual Tissue modeling accessible to users without extensive software development or programming experience.</p>\n\n<p>It uses Cellular Potts Model to model cell behavior.</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>CompuCell3D is a flexible scriptable modeling environment, which allows the rapid construction of sharable Virtual Tissue in-silico simulations of a wide variety of multi-scale, multi-cellular problems including angiogenesis, bacterial colonies, cancer, developmental biology, evolution, the immune system, tissue engineering, toxicology and even non-cellular soft materials. CompuCell3D models have been used to solve basic biological problems, to develop medical therapies, to assess modes of action of toxicants and to design engineered tissues. CompuCell3D intuitive and make Virtual Tissue modeling accessible to users without extensive software development or programming experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It uses Cellular Potts Model to model cell behavior.</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2018-05-06T14:07:59+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2018-04-11T14:17:59+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[{"target_id":4408,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"a0af7e9c-c3b7-4a1f-996e-6be1cf41706c","url":"/taxonomy/term/4408"},{"target_id":4409,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"c11a29ee-ae0a-4cc1-89bf-0f29422199e7","url":"/taxonomy/term/4409"},{"target_id":4410,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"6ed6afb9-12c5-4990-82ed-6db85d51b236","url":"/taxonomy/term/4410"},{"target_id":4321,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"15d834d3-4234-4d69-ab99-dba06e407b5b","url":"/taxonomy/term/4321"},{"target_id":4411,"targe